# =============================================================================
# Project : Project 6 - Python (FastAPI) App CI/CD on Google GKE
# Author  : Sanjay Naidu
# File    : .trivyignore - documented, time-boxed vulnerability exceptions
# =============================================================================
# Empty on purpose. The image scan blocks on HIGH/CRITICAL findings that have
# a fix available. If a finding ever has to be accepted, it goes here with:
#   - the CVE id
#   - WHY it is not exploitable in this app (or why no fix is possible)
#   - an expiry date to re-check
# Example:
#   # starlette multipart DoS; request bodies are capped by the LB and
#   # Cloud Armor. Re-check by 2026-12-31.
#   CVE-0000-00000
